  "published": "2026-08-28T03:53:37.263Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.4.1: chdman parity complete — 16 discrepancies fixed (createhd GDDD, extractcd cooked/raw, GD-ROM Redump, CLI strictness, copy defaults, parent hunk inheritance), DVD empty-payload parity, 32 MiB aligned extraction with correct audio byte-swap, and an audited CHD Deep Reference (MAME 0.289). Pure C# — zero native dependencies. Targets net8.0/net9.0/net10.0.",
